    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your death was just the beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Grim Reaper has secrets to share about your untimely demise. Nothing is as it seems, and your death was far from natural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662330/extras/1789165642f8648f7cacd9ffe3522408.webp?t=1733390995\" width=688 height=7 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Listen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a medieval audio drama brought to life by a cast of professional voice actors, including Neil Bell (<i>Dune</i>, <i>Peaky Blinders</i>). Immerse yourself in an intricate web of character-driven storylines that unfold simultaneously. Uncover clues that may either guide you or mislead you\u2014it\u2019s up to you to discern the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662330/extras/1789165642f8648f7cacd9ffe3522408.webp?t=1733390995\" width=688 height=7 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an unseen spectre, you\u2019ll explore pivotal moments frozen in time, seeking answers to pressing questions. Each revelation unravels a piece of a larger, interconnected mystery\u2014one that ties directly to your own fate.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your death was just the beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Grim Reaper has secrets to share about your untimely demise. Nothing is as it seems, and your death was far from natural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662330/extras/1789165642f8648f7cacd9ffe3522408.webp?t=1733390995\" width=688 height=7 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Listen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a medieval audio drama brought to life by a cast of professional voice actors, including Neil Bell (<i>Dune</i>, <i>Peaky Blinders</i>). Immerse yourself in an intricate web of character-driven storylines that unfold simultaneously. Uncover clues that may either guide you or mislead you\u2014it\u2019s up to you to discern the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662330/extras/1789165642f8648f7cacd9ffe3522408.webp?t=1733390995\" width=688 height=7 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an unseen spectre, you\u2019ll explore pivotal moments frozen in time, seeking answers to pressing questions. Each revelation unravels a piece of a larger, interconnected mystery\u2014one that ties directly to your own fate.</p>",
